      {
        "id": "textbook-cpu-vendor-and-standard",
        "moduleId": "standard-and-vendor",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "教材：CPU 的厂商与标准",
        "markdown": "教材先提醒读者区分两件事：CPU 有制造厂商，也有标准制定厂商。Apple Silicon 的指令集架构标准由 ARM 制定，因此在一些场合，人们会把 Mac 分为 Intel Mac 与 ARM Mac，用来说明它遵循的指令集架构来源。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000014"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "硬件基础",
                "CPU"
              ],
              "lineStart": 372,
              "lineEnd": 399,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2ece5e626b8b9d87c3b474cdb86a7a5b170d7755bb48a04d800b2b5dc498a9ab"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-standard-vs-product",
        "moduleId": "standard-and-vendor",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：标准与产品不是一回事",
        "markdown": "标准制定者规定“软件怎样控制 CPU”，制造厂商则按标准做出具体芯片。把 Mac 叫作 ARM Mac，说的是它使用的指令集架构来自 ARM，而不是说整台电脑由 ARM 生产。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-cpu-vendor-and-standard"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-isa-definition",
        "moduleId": "isa-interface",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：什么是指令集架构",
        "markdown": "指令集架构（Instruction Set Architecture，ISA）描述如何通过软件控制 CPU，是软件与硬件之间的一个中介。它定义支持的数据类型、寄存器、硬件如何操作主存储器等特性，总而言之，涵盖大部分与计算机体系结构相关的具体细节。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000014"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "硬件基础",
                "CPU"
              ],
              "lineStart": 372,
              "lineEnd": 399,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2ece5e626b8b9d87c3b474cdb86a7a5b170d7755bb48a04d800b2b5dc498a9ab"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-isa-as-contract",
        "moduleId": "isa-interface",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：把 ISA 想成一份约定",
        "markdown": "可以把 ISA 想成软件与硬件共同遵守的约定：软件按约定发出指令，硬件按约定解释这些指令。正因为它规定了寄存器、数据类型和访问主存储器的方式，同一个程序才能针对某一 ISA 被正确地翻译和执行。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-isa-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-armv8-profiles",
        "moduleId": "armv8-profiles",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "教材：ARMv8 的三个 Profile",
        "markdown": "ARMv8 处理器架构分为三个 Profile：\n\n| Profile | 名称 | 教材给出的定位 |\n|---|---|---|\n| ARMv8-A | Application | 高性能处理器架构 |\n| ARMv8-R | Real-Time | 针对实时系统进行优化 |\n| ARMv8-M | MicroController | 针对小型、低能耗、高能效的设备 |",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000014"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "硬件基础",
                "CPU"
              ],
              "lineStart": 372,
              "lineEnd": 399,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2ece5e626b8b9d87c3b474cdb86a7a5b170d7755bb48a04d800b2b5dc498a9ab"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-apple-silicon-armv8-a",
        "moduleId": "armv8-profiles",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "教材：Apple Silicon 采用 ARMv8-A",
        "markdown": "目前 Apple Silicon 使用的是 ARMv8-A Profile，也就是面向应用处理器、强调高性能的那一档，而不是面向实时系统的 ARMv8-R 或面向微控制器的 ARMv8-M。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000014"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "硬件基础",
                "CPU"
              ],
              "lineStart": 372,
              "lineEnd": 399,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2ece5e626b8b9d87c3b474cdb86a7a5b170d7755bb48a04d800b2b5dc498a9ab"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-profile-choice",
        "moduleId": "armv8-profiles",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "模型补充：按设备任务选择 Profile",
        "markdown": "三个 Profile 的差别不在“新旧”，而在目标场景：需要运行通用应用、追求高性能时对应 A；强调可预测响应时间的实时系统对应 R；资源受限的小型低能耗设备对应 M。因此看到 Apple Silicon 使用 ARMv8-A，就可以把它定位为面向应用处理器的高性能实现。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-armv8-profiles",
            "textbook-apple-silicon-armv8-a"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-execution-states",
        "moduleId": "execution-states",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：32 位与 64 位执行状态",
        "markdown": "ARMv8 指令集架构包含两个执行状态：32 位执行状态与 64 位执行状态，它们分别能执行 32 位应用程序与 64 位应用程序。64 位的执行状态被称为 AArch64；在许多应用开发过程中，也把 AArch64 称为指令集架构，意为 64 位的 ARM 指令集架构。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000014"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "硬件基础",
                "CPU"
              ],
              "lineStart": 372,
              "lineEnd": 399,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2ece5e626b8b9d87c3b474cdb86a7a5b170d7755bb48a04d800b2b5dc498a9ab"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-state-not-chip",
        "moduleId": "execution-states",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "模型补充：AArch64 不是一款芯片",
        "markdown": "容易混淆的地方在于：AArch64 描述的是 CPU 的一种 64 位执行状态，而不是某款处理器或某个厂商的芯片名称。ARMv8 指令集架构包含 32 位与 64 位两种执行状态；当 CPU 运行 64 位应用时，就处于 AArch64 状态。教材也指出，开发语境中常把 AArch64 直接称作 64 位 ARM 指令集架构，这是术语使用上的简称。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-execution-states"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-a64-and-cortex",
        "moduleId": "execution-states",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "教材：A64 指令集与 Cortex 系列",
        "markdown": "CPU 可以执行的指令组成的集合称为指令集（Instruction Set）。在 AArch64 状态下，指令集是 A64 指令集。教材还补充，ARM 也自己研发处理器，其处理器一般命名为 Cortex 系列。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000014"
              ],
